That's about as simple as that.

382
00:16:15,280 --> 00:16:17,280
It's as simple as I can put economics.

383
00:16:17,280 --> 00:16:21,280
We get paid for bringing value to the marketplace.

384
00:16:21,280 --> 00:16:26,280
Now, it takes time to bring value to the marketplace.

